<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="ko">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>STUDY4 - Better English, Brighter Future</title>

<style>

* {

    margin: 0;

    padding: 0;

    box-sizing: border-box;

}

body {

    font-family: Arial, "Malgun Gothic", sans-serif;

    background: #f8faff;

    color: #17213b;

}

.container {

    max-width: 1100px;

    margin: auto;

    padding: 20px;

}

/* HEADER */

header {

    display: flex;

    align-items: center;

    justify-content: space-between;

    background: white;

    padding: 18px 25px;

    border-radius: 12px;

    box-shadow: 0 2px 10px #dce3f1;

}

.logo {

    font-size: 25px;

    font-weight: bold;

    color: #2861c5;

}

nav {

    display: flex;

    gap: 35px;

}

nav a {

    text-decoration: none;

    color: #222;

    font-weight: bold;

    font-size: 15px;

}

.icons {

    font-size: 21px;

    display: flex;

    gap: 20px;

}

/* HERO BANNER */

.hero {

    margin-top: 20px;

    padding: 55px 40px;

    min-height: 300px;

    border-radius: 12px;

    background: linear-gradient(120deg, #e8f1ff, #c7dcff);

    display: flex;

    align-items: center;

    justify-content: space-between;

    overflow: hidden;

}

.hero-text {

    max-width: 55%;

}

.hero h1 {

    font-size: 30px;

    margin-bottom: 20px;

}

.hero p {

    font-size: 17px;

    line-height: 1.7;

    margin-bottom: 20px;

}

.hero button {

    background: #315bb2;

    color: white;

    border: none;

    padding: 14px 28px;

    border-radius: 30px;

    font-size: 16px;

    font-weight: bold;

    cursor: pointer;

}

.hero-image {

    font-size: 125px;

    padding: 20px;

}

/* SECTION */

.section-title {

    margin: 35px 0 20px;

    display: flex;

    justify-content: space-between;

    align-items: center;

}

.section-title h2 {

    font-size: 23px;

    border-left: 5px solid #3164c5;

    padding-left: 12px;

}

.section-title a {

    color: #3164c5;

    text-decoration: none;

    font-weight: bold;

}

/* COURSE CARDS */

.course-grid {

    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);

    gap: 22px;

}

.course-card {

    background: white;

    border: 1px solid #e2e7f0;

    border-radius: 15px;

    padding: 20px;

    box-shadow: 0 3px 10px #e4e9f2;

}

.course-brand {

    font-size: 12px;

    font-weight: bold;

    margin-bottom: 12px;

}

.course-top {

    display: flex;

    justify-content: space-between;

    align-items: center;

}

.course-name {

    font-size: 25px;

    font-weight: bold;

    font-style: italic;

}

.course-image {

    width: 105px;

    height: 85px;

    border-radius: 12px;

    display: flex;

    align-items: center;

    justify-content: center;

    font-size: 45px;

}

.yellow { background: #fff0a6; }

.blue { background: #d5e4ff; }

.purple { background: #e8dcff; }

.green { background: #d4f4e9; }

.course-subtitle {

    font-size: 12px;

    background: #eef2f8;

    display: inline-block;

    padding: 4px 7px;

    border-radius: 15px;

    margin-top: 5px;

}

.description {

    margin-top: 15px;

    font-size: 14px;

    line-height: 1.6;

    min-height: 45px;

}

.price-row {

    display: flex;

    align-items: center;

    gap: 12px;

    margin: 15px 0;

}

.sale-price {

    color: #419c65;

    font-size: 22px;

    font-weight: bold;

}

.original-price {

    color: #999;

    text-decoration: line-through;

    font-size: 14px;

}

.discount {

    background: #e94e62;

    color: white;

    padding: 5px 9px;

    border-radius: 8px;

    font-size: 13px;

    font-weight: bold;

}

.apply-button {

    width: 100%;

    padding: 13px;

    background: #315bb2;

    color: white;

    border: none;

    border-radius: 9px;

    font-size: 16px;

    font-weight: bold;

    cursor: pointer;

}

.apply-button:hover,

.hero button:hover {

    background: #193f91;

}

/* FOOTER */

footer {

    text-align: center;

    padding: 30px;

    color: #888;

    font-size: 13px;

}

/* MOBILE */

@media (max-width: 650px) {

    .container {

        padding: 12px;

    }

    header {

        padding: 15px;

    }

    nav {

        display: none;

    }

    .hero {

        padding: 30px 20px;

        min-height: 230px;

    }

    .hero-text {

        max-width: 100%;

    }

    .hero h1 {

        font-size: 22px;

    }

    .hero p {

        font-size: 14px;

    }

    .hero-image {

        display: none;

    }

    .course-grid {

        grid-template-columns: 1fr;

        gap: 15px;

    }

    .course-name {

        font-size: 21px;

    }

    .section-title h2 {

        font-size: 19px;

    }

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <!-- HEADER -->

    <header>

        <div class="logo">🎓 STUDY4</div>

        <nav>

            <a href="#">강좌 안내 ⌄</a>

            <a href="#">이용 안내 ⌄</a>

            <a href="#">고객센터</a>

        </nav>

        <div class="icons">

            <span>⌕</span>

            <span>♙</span>

        </div>

    </header>

    <!-- HERO -->

    <section class="hero">

        <div class="hero-text">

            <h1>지금, 더 나은 영어를 시작하세요!</h1>

            <p>

                STUDY4와 함께하는 온라인 영어 학습,<br>

                당신의 목표를 응원합니다.

            </p>

            <button onclick="showMessage('영어 학습을 시작합니다!')">

                지금 시작하기 ❯

            </button>

        </div>

        <div class="hero-image">

            👩🏻‍💻

        </div>

    </section>

    <!-- COURSE SECTION -->

    <div class="section-title">

        <h2>추천 강좌</h2>

        <a href="#">전체 보기 ❯</a>

    </div>

    <section class="course-grid">

        <!-- TOEIC LISTENING -->

        <div class="course-card">

            <div class="course-brand">STUDY4</div>

            <div class="course-top">

                <div>

                    <div class="course-name">

                        <span style="color:#315bb2">TOEIC</span>

                        <span style="color:#e34d5e">L&R</span>

                    </div>

                    <div class="course-subtitle">

                        LISTENING & READING

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="course-image yellow">🖥️</div>

            </div>

            <p class="description">

                [Complete TOEIC] 최신판 완벽 대비를<br>

                한 번에! 실전 대비 완벽 강좌

            </p>

            <div class="price-row">

                <span class="sale-price">1.050.000đ</span>

                <span class="original-price">1.800.000đ</span>

                <span class="discount">-41%</span>

            </div>

            <button class="apply-button"

                onclick="applyCourse('TOEIC L&R')">

                수강 신청하기 ❯

            </button>

        </div>

        <!-- TOEIC SPEAKING -->

        <div class="course-card">

            <div class="course-brand">STUDY4</div>

            <div class="course-top">

                <div>

                    <div class="course-name">

                        <span style="color:#315bb2">TOEIC</span> Speaking

                    </div>

                    <div class="course-subtitle">

                        Speaking for Your Success

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="course-image blue">🎤</div>

            </div>

            <p class="description">

                [Complete TOEIC Speaking]<br>

                실전처럼 연습하는 스피킹 강좌

            </p>

            <div class="price-row">

                <span class="sale-price">950.000đ</span>

                <span class="original-price">1.600.000đ</span>

                <span class="discount">-41%</span>

            </div>

            <button class="apply-button"

                onclick="applyCourse('TOEIC Speaking')">

                수강 신청하기 ❯

            </button>

        </div>

        <!-- TOEIC GRAMMAR -->

        <div class="course-card">

            <div class="course-brand">STUDY4</div>

            <div class="course-top">

                <div>

                    <div class="course-name">

                        <span style="color:#315bb2">TOEIC</span> Grammar

                    </div>

                    <div class="course-subtitle">

                        Grammar Made Easy

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="course-image purple">📚</div>

            </div>

            <p class="description">

                [Complete TOEIC Grammar]<br>

                문법부터 탄탄하게!

            </p>

            <div class="price-row">

                <span class="sale-price">800.000đ</span>

                <span class="original-price">1.300.000đ</span>

                <span class="discount">-38%</span>

            </div>

            <button class="apply-button"

                onclick="applyCourse('TOEIC Grammar')">

                수강 신청하기 ❯

            </button>

        </div>

        <!-- BUSINESS ENGLISH -->

        <div class="course-card">

            <div class="course-brand">STUDY4</div>

            <div class="course-top">

                <div>

                    <div class="course-name">

                        Business English

                    </div>

                    <div class="course-subtitle">

                        Speak Business Confidently

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="course-image green">📊</div>

            </div>

            <p class="description">

                [Business English]<br>

                비즈니스 영어 완성 과정

            </p>

            <div class="price-row">

                <span class="sale-price">900.000đ</span>

                <span class="original-price">1.500.000đ</span>

                <span class="discount">-40%</span>

            </div>

            <button class="apply-button"

                onclick="applyCourse('Business English')">

                수강 신청하기 ❯

            </button>

        </div>

    </section>

</div>

<footer>

    © 2026 STUDY4. All Rights Reserved.

</footer>

<script>

function showMessage(message) {

    alert(message);

}

function applyCourse(courseName) {

    alert(courseName + ' 강좌를 선택하셨습니다!');

}

</script>

</body>

</html>
